  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.246,
      0.112,
      0.725,
      0.13
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\nv _ {t} = [ \\nabla_ {y y} ^ {2} g (x _ {t}, y _ {t}) - \\nabla_ {y y} ^ {2} G (x _ {t}, y _ {t}; \\zeta_ {t}) ] z _ {t} - [ \\nabla_ {y} f (x _ {t}, y _ {t}) - \\nabla_ {y} F (x _ {t}, y _ {t}; \\xi_ {t}) ].\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.086,
      0.14,
      0.498,
      0.157
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "Next, given any \\(\\delta_t > 0\\), we apply Young's inequality to obtain",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.332,
      0.166,
      0.888,
      0.194
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\langle v _ {t}, z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\rangle \\leq \\frac {\\delta_ {t}}{2} \\| v _ {t} \\| ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2 \\delta_ {t}} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2}. \\tag {E.4}\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.086,
      0.204,
      0.554,
      0.22
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "Also, we estimate the following by Young's inequality (with \\(\\phi_t = 4\\gamma\\)):",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.116,
      0.23,
      0.888,
      0.363
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{l} \\langle \\nabla_ {y y} ^ {2} g (x _ {t}, y _ {t} ^ {*}) z _ {t} - \\nabla_ {y y} ^ {2} g (x _ {t}, y _ {t}) z _ {t, z _ {t + 1}} - z _ {t} \\rangle \\leq \\frac {\\phi_ {t}}{2} \\| \\nabla_ {y y} ^ {2} g (x _ {t}, y _ {t} ^ {*}) - \\nabla_ {y y} ^ {2} g (x _ {t}, y _ {t}) \\| ^ {2} \\| z _ {t} \\| ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2 \\phi_ {t}} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2} \\\\ \\leq \\frac {\\phi_ {t}}{2} l _ {g, 2} ^ {2} \\| y _ {t} - y _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} (2 \\| z _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} + 2 \\| z _ {t} - z _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2}) + \\frac {1}{2 \\phi_ {t}} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2} \\\\ \\leq \\frac {\\phi_ {t}}{2} l _ {g, 2} ^ {2} \\| y _ {t} - y _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} \\left(\\frac {2 l _ {f , 0} ^ {2}}{\\mu^ {2}} + 2 \\| z _ {t} - z _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2}\\right) + \\frac {1}{2 \\phi_ {t}} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2} \\tag {E.5} \\\\ \\leq 4 \\gamma l _ {g, 2} ^ {2} \\| y _ {t} - y _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} \\| z _ {t} - z _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} + 4 \\gamma \\frac {l _ {g , 2} ^ {2} l _ {f , 0} ^ {2}}{\\mu^ {2}} \\| y _ {t} - y _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} + \\frac {(4 \\gamma) ^ {- 1}}{2} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2}, \\\\ \\end{array}\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.085,
      0.372,
      0.714,
      0.391
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "where we use \\( \\| z_t^* \\| = \\| [\\nabla_{yy}^2 g(x,y^*(x))]^{-1}\\nabla_y f(x,y^*(x)) \\| \\leq l_{f,0} / \\mu \\) for the second inequality.",
    "merge_prev": false
