    "angle": 0,
    "content": "Again we apply Young's inequality to estimate (with \\(\\varphi_t = 4\\gamma\\)):",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.174,
      0.42,
      0.89,
      0.512
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\begin{array}{l} \\langle \\nabla_ {y} f (x _ {t}, y _ {t}) - \\nabla_ {y} f (x _ {t}, y _ {t} ^ {*}), z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\rangle \\leq \\frac {\\varphi_ {t}}{2} \\| \\nabla_ {y} f (x _ {t}, y _ {t}) - \\nabla_ {y} f (x _ {t}, y _ {t} ^ {*}) \\| ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2 \\varphi_ {t}} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2} \\\\ \\leq \\frac {\\varphi_ {t}}{2} (L _ {y, 0} + L _ {y, 1} l _ {f, 0}) ^ {2} \\| y _ {t} - y _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2 \\varphi_ {t}} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2} \\tag {E.6} \\\\ \\leq 2 \\gamma (L _ {y, 0} + L _ {y, 1} l _ {f, 0}) ^ {2} \\| y _ {t} - y _ {t} ^ {*} \\| ^ {2} + \\frac {(4 \\gamma) ^ {- 1}}{2} \\| z _ {t + 1} - z _ {t} \\| ^ {2}. \\\\ \\end{array}\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.086,
      0.527,
      0.559,
      0.542
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "Therefore, given any \\(z\\), combining (E.3), (E.4), (E.5) and (E.6) we have",
    "merge_prev": false
