    "angle": 0,
    "content": "where the last inequality holds since \\( z_{t+1} = z_t - \\gamma[\\nabla_{yy}^2 G(x_t, y_t; \\zeta_t) z_t - \\nabla_y F(x_t, y_t; \\xi_t)] \\) is the unique minimizer of the \\( \\gamma^{-1} \\)-strongly convex function \\( l(z) = \\langle \\nabla_{yy}^2 G(x_t, y_t; \\zeta_t) z_t - \\nabla_y F(x_t, y_t; \\xi_t), z - z_t \\rangle + \\frac{1}{2\\gamma} \\|z - z_t\\|^2 \\), and thus",
